title: <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> Leadership Vote
subtitle: The <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> chooses a new leader...
view-if: year = 1928 and month = 10
max-visits: 1
tags: event
face-image: img/dnvp_congress.jpg
new-page: true

= <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> Congress

A leadership vote is being held at the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span>'s congress following the resignation of its former leader Kuno von Westarp.

The right wing of the party rallied behind Alfred Hugenberg, an industrialist and head of a media empire. The moderate wing supports Oskar Hergt.

- @resultsdnvp: The party votes...

@resultsdnvp
on-arrival: {!
Q.event_points = 0;
Q.event_points += (Q.pro_republic - 60)/10;
Q.event_points -= (Q.nationalism - 60)/10;
if (Q.dnvp_in_government) Q.event_points += 1;
!}
go-to: hergt if event_points >= 1; triumvirate if event_points >= 0.5 and event_points < 1; hugenberg if event_points < 0.5

@hergt
on-arrival: dnvp_leader = "Hergt"; dnvp_ideology = "National Conservatism"; dnvp_color = "#3F7BC1"; dnvp_left = 0; dvp_left -= 1; dnvp_relation += 7*(1-dissent) if dvp_left < 0;
face-image: img/portraits/HergtOskar.jpg

Hergt is elected to lead the <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**DNVP**</span>. In response, Hugenberg and his faction have left <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**DNVP**</span> to form their own party.

- @dnf_formation: Alfred Hugenberg and his supporters form <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span>.

@dnf_formation
face-image: img/hugenberg_boat.jpg
go-to: dnf_formed

Hugenberg has created a new party.

@triumvirate
on-arrival: dnvp_leader = "Triumvirate"; dnvp_ideology = "National Conservatism"; dnvp_left = -1; dnvp_color = "#3F7BC1"; dvp_left -= 1; dnvp_relation += 5*(1-dissent) if dvp_left < 0;
face-image: img/portraits/WestarpKuno.jpg

With neither candidate able to convince a majority of <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**DNVP**</span> members, some of their members still on the fence have suggested a triumvirate between Hugenberg, Westarp and a prussian candidate. Westarp is not enthusiastic of such a proposal, but accepts for the sake of party unity.

@hugenberg
on-arrival: dnvp_leader = "Hugenberg"; dnvp_left = -2; dnvp_color = "#003755"; workers_dnvp -= 2; pro_republic -= 2; dvp_left += 1; dnvp_relation -= 5 if dvp_left >= 0;
face-image: img/portraits/HugenbergAlfred.jpg

Hugenberg is elected chairman, single-handedly shifting our party away from the <span style="color: var(--dnvp-color);">**DNVP**</span>.
